E	import display.TestSystem; import display.CNST; host.parent.leftMHDD.selectFormat(CNST.FORMAT.BLANK); host.parent.centreMHDD.selectFormat(CNST.FORMAT.BLANK); host.parent.rightMHDD.selectFormat(CNST.FORMAT.BLANK);
PR	Confirm Dashboard visible (GREEN - PASS, RED - FAIL)
PR	Confirm 3 display screens with 4 buttons each visible (GREEN - PASS, RED - FAIL)
PR	Confirm all displays show 'BLANK FORMAT' (GREEN - PASS, RED - FAIL)
E	import display.TestSystem; import display.CNST; host.parent.leftMHDD.selectFormat(CNST.FORMAT.RADAR); host.parent.centreMHDD.selectFormat(CNST.FORMAT.NAV); host.parent.rightMHDD.selectFormat(CNST.FORMAT.WEAPONS);
PR	Confirm displays show LEFT - RADAR, CENTRE - NAV, RIGHT - WEAPONS (GREEN - PASS, RED - FAIL)
PR	Press 'FORM MENU' button on all displays and confirm format menu displayed  (GREEN - PASS, RED - FAIL)
PR	Select new format on all displays and confirm successful  (GREEN - PASS, RED - FAIL



